nt":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/api/roles/memories":{"get":{"summary":"Role Memories","description":"角色记忆列表（按 importance × 新鲜度降序取 top 条），供角色管理页展示。\n\n返回每条记忆的 text / importance / created_at / last_hit / hit_count，\n不暴露内部 id 之外的敏感字段。","operationId":"role_memories_api_roles_memories_get","parameters":[{"name":"role","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","default":"","title":"Role"}},{"name":"top","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","default":10,"title":"Top"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/greeting":{"post":{"summary":"Role Greeting","description":"主动问候：基于记忆+情绪+时间生成大帅的主动开场白。\n\n前端在页面打开时按阈值调用（距上次聊天够久 / 新的一天还没问候过）。\n频率控制在前端 localStorage（每天最多 1-2 次），后端只负责生成。","operationId":"role_greeting_api_greeting_post","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/api/tts":{"post":{"summary":"Tts","operationId":"tts_api_tts_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"additionalProperties":true,"type":"object","title":"Req"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/tts/file":{"get":{"summary":"Tts File","description":"持久可回放/可下载音频端点。\n\n前端把 POST /api/tts 返回的 X-TTS-Cache（缓存文件名）拼成\n/api/tts/file?h=<hash> 写入消息体（msg.audio）。刷新/切会话后该 URL 仍有效，\n直接播放或下载，无需重新合成（只要 tts_cache 里文件未被清理阈值回收）。\n兜底：未带 h 时按 文本+风格+当前音色指纹 重新定位，兼容老消息/音色未变场景。","operationId":"tts_file_api_tts_file_get","parameters":[{"name":"h","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","default":"","title":"H"}},{"name":"text","in":"query","required":false,"schema":